{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"MollieComponents"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"Theming"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"There is no public API to customize colors, typography, or corner radius. Every entry point — ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCheckout","type":"reference"},{"text":"’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"presentCard(from:)"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"makeCardComponent(onResult:)"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCardComponent","type":"reference"},{"text":" directly — always renders with the same Mollie-branded default theme.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let checkout = try MollieCheckout(clientToken: clientToken)","let result = await checkout.presentCard(from: viewController)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is intentional: it keeps the payment surface’s visual trust signals consistent across merchant integrations. If your integration needs a different look, embed "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCardComponent"},{"type":"text","text":" inside your own layout and style the surrounding chrome — the form itself is not restylable."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/molliecomponents\/theming"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The payment sheet always renders with Mollie’s branded appearance."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/Theming"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"